---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy · pace.tools"
  description="Privacy notice for pace.tools."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="privacy-page">
    <header class="privacy-header">
      <span class="privacy-eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>What pace.tools does</h2>
      <p>
        Pace.tools is a static website. It does not collect personal data, set tracking cookies, or run analytics on visitors.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>What the CLI does</h2>
      <p>
        The <code>npx pace skills install</code> CLI runs entirely on your machine. It downloads skill bundles from GitHub through <code>npx skills add</code>. No identifying information is sent back to pace.tools.
      </p>
      <p>
        Network traffic goes to <a href="https://github.com">github.com</a> (to fetch the harness output dirs) and, if you accept the optional install, to <a href="https://impeccable.style">impeccable.style</a> through <code>npx impeccable skills install</code>. Each of those services has its own privacy posture.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        Pace.tools is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect standard web request logs for security and operations. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> for details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/GoldenBerry-SO/pace.tools/issues">Open an issue on GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    max-width: var(--width-content);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-3xl);
  }
  .privacy-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  .privacy-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .privacy-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  .privacy-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .privacy-section p {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }
  code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92em;
    background: var(--color-code-bg);
    padding: 1px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-code-border);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
</style>
